    "body": "Triage: `bug`, `P3`, `area:build`, `effort:medium`. Thank you for the report.\n\n- Priority: `cargo xtask catalog --check` is a check that a contributor runs by hand. It is not a step of the quick, batch or release gate, and the post-merge gate of `main` is green without it. Thus this is not a red `main` (`P2`). It is wrong behaviour that a user finds, with a workaround (do not use the result of the check for the case `2d/drill-overfeed`): `P3`.\n- Effort: the work is in one module of `xtask` (the catalog checker) and follows a known pattern: `effort:medium`.\n- No `source:agent`: a person opened this issue.\n\nThe fix changes `xtask/`, so its PR has the line `Process change: yes`.\n\nNobody has claimed this issue. It is in the pick queue of the bug lane.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
